<title>KENYA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 203 ALL OUT V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 203 ALL OUT V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 203 from 46.2 overs in the Kenyan centenary four-nation one-day tournament final against South Africa on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 203 off 46.2 overs v South Africa,</p>
